From 110bf3e4e80abf177821dac4bf26e6e94d6a1e40 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 14:07:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] port: Q1_0 repack scaffolding + Arm NEON/DP GEMV-GEMM kernels

UNDECLARED PREREQUISITE of the VNNI repack slot. The merge manifest names the
slot as two commits (9fcaed763 + 79697f23a); the slot sweep found two more
(0e0353d7a, 4d88cd4eb). This is a FIFTH, which neither the manifest nor the
sweep declared, and without it 9fcaed763 does not compile: it edits the Q1_0
repack arm, the block_q1_0x4 traits and the x86 arch-fallback entries that only
exist once this lands.

What it adds:
- repack.h: QK_0<1>() -> QK1_0, block<1,4> == block_q1_0x4 (+ size static_assert),
  gemv/gemm q1_0_4x4 and q1_0_4x8 declarations
- repack.cpp: generic gemv/gemm for both layouts, make_block_q1_0x4,
  repack_q1_0_to_q1_0_4_bl, the repack/gemv/gemm<block_q1_0,...> template
  specialisations, and the GGML_TYPE_Q1_0 arm in
  ggml_repack_get_optimal_repack_type()
- arch/arm/repack.cpp: NEON+DP kernels (aarch64 only)
- arch-fallback.h: generic aliases for every non-ARM arch

Applied clean on our master - no conflict with the PowerInfer repack carve-out
56e975ed4. The carve-out sits at the top of ggml_repack_get_optimal_repack_type()
and returns nullptr by tensor NAME; this appends a type arm at the bottom of the
same if/else chain, so the two never meet.

ARM-only at runtime today (the dispatch requires ggml_cpu_has_neon() &&
ggml_cpu_has_matmul_int8()). Carried per merge-ALL, and it is not inert on
planned hardware - the DGX Spark GB10 is ARM. UNMEASURED: no ARM host here.

Taken-from: PrismML-Eng/llama.cpp@720e06b16
Origin: ArifiLabs/vnni-repack
Conflict-resolved: auto: affix(one side only added lines around the base, other side edited it) in ggml/src/ggml-cpu/arch-fallback.h
Conflict-resolved: S5: upstream 8034c1d1f (ARM Repack kernels for Q1_0, #23492) is the merged form of the PR this commit ported (added lines identical in all four files, CHECKED); took upstream's four files - kept only our make_block_q4_0x4 unsigned blck_size_interleave
